# Keep the build context small and avoid leaking local build output or secrets
# into images.

# .NET build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Angular build output and dependencies
daedala/node_modules/
daedala/dist/
daedala/.angular/

# Runtime uploads (served from a volume in the container)
Daedala/wwwroot/uploads/

# Environment secrets — never bake these into an image.
.env
*.env.local

# Editor / VCS noise
.git/
.gitignore
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user

# AI assistant metadata
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
